{"overview":"داستان یک خانواده طبقه متوسط که با مرگ ناگهانی پدر مهربانشان، پاتریک، مخترع خیال‌پردازی که بر زندگی همهٔ اطرافیانش تأثیر گذاشته بود، کنار می‌آیند. خانوادهٔ غم‌زده، امید خود را در کتاب راهنمایی که او برای پسرانش نوشته بود، می‌یابند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The story of a middle-class family coping with the sudden passing of their beloved patriarch Patrick, a whimsical inventor who touched the lives of all who knew him. Devastated, his family finds hope in a guide book he created for his sons.","tagline_en":"","runtime":30,"status":"Canceled","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":6,"y":2018,"poster":"/sU4tfnvxpqDwr4n4usyNYrjdtQ8.jpg"}],"episodes":6,"crew":["Greg Mottola","برایان کرانستون"],"crew_en":["Greg Mottola","Bryan Cranston"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"کریس دیامانتوپولوس","role":"Patrick / Terry McKenna","photo":"/oenBtpk0RTId4wacQKYU4cPcq8Z.jpg","en":"Chris Diamantopoulos"},{"name":"گابریل بیتمن","role":"Wyatt McKenna","photo":"/6qNrduicWPPaMR2Vst2BJL4XyQb.jpg","en":"Gabriel Bateman"},{"name":"Drew Powell","role":"Dash McKenna","photo":"/v3iLHQYKDdd7AI8GOqMwqxhzeMH.jpg"},{"name":"Kyan Zielinski","role":"Liam McKenna","photo":"/59WDlqMo44wG3D5caSTx9YxPXkp.jpg"},{"name":"Erinn Hayes","role":"Beth McKenna","photo":"/iesmfFl12Dgb8mb1jCKMGsIcQ9o.jpg"},{"name":"Swoosie Kurtz","role":"Tiffany McKenna","photo":"/uCHMttpxVITjDXtjs8FS6O7TQHx.jpg"}],"trailer":"YTJrFqoslaI","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/77345-the-dangerous-book-for-boys/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tpwTT1FpWqLLhxUfAuDavIXDDfI.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/77345-the-dangerous-book-for-boys/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tpwTT1FpWqLLhxUfAuDavIXDDfI.png"}]},"CA